%% Auto-Remediation Pipeline: Governed Incident Resolution
%% Render with: https://mermaid.live or any Mermaid-compatible tool

sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Obs as Observability
  participant Or as Orchestrator
  participant Ta as Triage Agent
  participant Da as Diagnostics Agent
  participant Pe as Policy Engine
  participant Ha as Human Approver
  participant Tr as Tool Runner
  participant Ts as Target System
  participant Va as Validator
  participant It as ITSM Record

  Obs->>Or: Alert/event bundle (signal + metadata)
  Or->>Ta: Create/Update incident draft + context
  Ta->>It: Incident created/updated (classification, service, priority)

  Or->>Da: Fetch telemetry evidence (logs/metrics/traces)
  Da-->>Or: Hypotheses + confidence + required probes

  Or->>Or: Build remediation plan (steps + tools + budgets)
  Or->>Pe: Policy check (risk_score, SoD, allowlist, limits)

  alt low risk + policy allows
    Pe-->>Tr: allow(plan) + constraints
  else needs approval
    Pe-->>Ha: approval request + evidence bundle
    Ha-->>Tr: approve(plan) + constraints
  else denied
    Pe-->>It: deny + rationale + next steps
  end

  Tr->>Ts: execute tool calls (dry-run → apply)
  Ts-->>Tr: execution logs + outputs

  Tr->>Va: validate service health (SLO + synthetic + smoke)
  alt validation pass
    Va-->>It: resolve + attach evidence bundle
  else validation fail
    Va-->>Tr: rollback_required(reason)
    Tr->>Ts: rollback execution
    Tr-->>It: escalate + attach evidence bundle
  end
